{"data":{"ExtRef_Child_hu_note":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"（癸卯、一○三）","note_content_jianti_auto":"（癸卯、一○三）","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"95a97b01-db0e-11ef-98b2-a0d3651f611f"},"ExtRef_Children_contents":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"鄭氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑氏","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"95a97b04-db0e-11ef-8734-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"詩·小雅·蓼莪之篇曰：父兮生我，母兮鞠我，顧我復我，出入腹我。鄭氏箋曰：顧，旋視也；復，反覆也。離，力智翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"诗·小雅·蓼莪之篇曰：父兮生我，母兮鞠我，顾我复我，出入腹我。郑氏笺曰：顾，旋视也；复，反复也。离，力智翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"95a97b03-db0e-11ef-aced-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"詩·小雅曰：蓼蓼者莪，匪莪伊蒿，哀哀父母，生我劬勞。又國風曰：凱風自南，吹彼棘心。棘心夭夭，母氏劬勞。蓼，力竹翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"诗·小雅曰：蓼蓼者莪，匪莪伊蒿，哀哀父母，生我劬劳。又国风曰：凯风自南，吹彼棘心。棘心夭夭，母氏劬劳。蓼，力竹翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"95a97b08-db0e-11ef-8dae-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"95a97b0c-db0e-11ef-a4b8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：選懦，慈戀不決之意也。懦，音人兗翻。復，扶又翻。宿，音秀。留，音溜。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：选懦，慈恋不决之意也。懦，音人兖翻。复，扶又翻。宿，音秀。留，音溜。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"95a97b0b-db0e-11ef-bad7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":56,"link_death_year":88,"link_td_description":"汉章帝刘炟，汉明帝刘庄第五子，东汉皇帝（75年9月5日—88年4月9日在位），其正式谥号为「孝章皇帝」，后世省略「孝」字称「汉章帝」，庙号肃宗。在位13年，享年31岁。","link_td_id":"Q10000133","link_td_number_id":79436,"people_name":"肅宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"肃宗","people_xingming":"刘炟","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"95a97b0d-db0e-11ef-874b-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘炟]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","resolved_place_entity_id":56,"start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"95a97b0e-db0e-11ef-a1da-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"1夏，四月，甲子晦，日有食之。時帝遵肅宗故事，兄弟皆留京師，有司以日食陰盛，奏遣諸王就國。詔曰：「甲子之異，責由一人。諸王幼穉，早離顧復，弱冠相育，常有蓼莪、凱風之哀。選懦之恩，知非國典，且復宿留。」","content_fanyi":"夏季，四月三十日甲子晦，发生日食。当时，汉和帝遵循汉章帝的旧例，兄弟们都留在京城，主管官员认为日食是阴气太盛所致，上奏请求遣送各位诸侯王回封国。和帝下诏说：“甲子日的异常天象，责任在于朕一人。各位诸侯王年龄幼小，早早失去父母的照料，成年后相互照顾，常常怀有《诗经》中的《蓼莪》《凯风》所表达的哀痛。朕出于手足亲情，不忍心把年幼弱小的各位诸侯王遣送回封国，明知这种私恩不合国家法度，姑且让他们再留居京城。”","content_jianti_auto":"1夏，四月，甲子晦，日有食之。时帝遵肃宗故事，兄弟皆留京师，有司以日食阴盛，奏遣诸王就国。诏曰：「甲子之异，责由一人。诸王幼穉，早离顾复，弱冠相育，常有蓼莪、凯风之哀。选懦之恩，知非国典，且复宿留。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"。呜呼！天其欲使人主绝毛里之恩，蔑鞠子之哀，忍忮以逞阳刚...","context_before":"和帝之世，正阳之月，日有食之，","source_end_index":35,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a360382b-645a-4a88-8921-4b1b0db54bbe","source_start_index":15,"source_text":"有司无以塞咎，举而归之兄弟诸王留京师之应"}],"title":"九 不可以天象预测人事"}],"id":3912,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"95a97b02-db0e-11ef-a1b1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions"